<title>UK: Mediocredito sets 300 bln lire 7-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Mediocredito sets 300 bln lire 7-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo, BNL and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEDIOCREDITO LOMBARDO SPA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN  ** +35 BP    PAY DATE    =d.mmm.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.80     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SW/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **WITH A MOMENTUM CAP OF 40 BP OVER PREVIOUS COUPON</p>
<p>		FIRST COUPON FIXED AT 7.06 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
